        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="cae2-8b92-47c4-6e61" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="54c9-a9ca-4855-45e3" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Surge of Wrath (Psychic)" id="3caa-56f9-f23c-70c4" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: While making melee attacks against MONSTER or VEHICLE targets:
  -&gt; You can re-roll the Hit roll for attacks made by this model.
  -&gt; You can re-roll the Wound roll for attacks made by this model.
  -&gt; You can re-roll the Damage roll for attacks made by this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="57dd-b5b5-1048-8840" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Warrior Strategist" id="7cd3-313d-f001-fb73" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time you target the unit with a Stratagem, you may use this ability, once per battle round per army, reduce the CP cost of that use of the Stratagem by 1CP (to a minimum of 0CP).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
