          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a unit with the Deep Strike ability disembarks from this Transport, if this model made a Normal move this turn, the triggering unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it disembarked this turn.</characteristic>
