      <profiles>
        <profile name="Venerable Dreadnought" id="d45f-2384-3392-d8e8" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">8"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">2+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">6+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">60mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="4f0d-7415-afe6-1a33" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Guidance of the Ancients (Psychic)" id="4474-c237-5101-1576" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence (your Guidance of the Ancients target). Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly unit makes an attack against it, all friendly GREY KNIGHTS models get +1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="4f44-d3ab-010e-2950" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
