      <profiles>
        <profile name="Righteous Persecution" id="5713-8a19-f908-cc2d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the MONSTER keyword and the selected unit does not have the VEHICLE keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as pinned.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged pinned, subtract 2 from that unit's Move characteristic.
    -&gt; While the selected unit is tagged pinned, that unit gets -2 to Charge rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="27d4-e905-dd30-a9a1" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Gate of Infinity" id="2017-c5c0-f6b4-c234" hidden="false" targetId="1426-6657-b497-fa07" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
