          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While making ranged attacks against a unit that is not a FLY, this model gets +1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="6b36-d59b-aea6-ea33" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
