        <profile name="Personal Teleporters" id="2f3d-722f-dbf7-e579" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while the unit is unengaged, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; The unit can make a Normal move of up to 6" as if it were your Movement phase.
  -&gt; The unit cannot declare a charge.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deep Strike" id="bd5b-e065-6c32-8343" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit ends an ingress move, while the unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
