    <selectionEntry name="Detachment" id="c05f-e67a-d2db-b3de" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="f266-6381-1c6e-3558" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="134a-6a08-4186-e1f4" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="26f5-e908-ce77-59ba" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="4ac9-fd30-1e3d-b249"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Detachment" id="fd8a-bd32-44cc-ec67" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="bc4b-785e-ff9a-c387" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Augurium Task Force" id="9ed8-0b64-4e6a-5733" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="5fd5-17f9-d691-73da" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Prescient Redeployment" id="1306-145d-e869-aea1" hidden="false">
                  <description>At the start of your Movement phase, if during the second battle round onward and the gate of infinity grey knights ability had unused selection capacity at the end of the opponent's previous turn, you may use this ability, when resolving this use:
  -&gt; Select one friendly GREY KNIGHTS unit that is on the battlefield and the candidate was eligible for the gate of infinity grey knights ability at the end of the opponent's previous turn: that unit can be placed into Strategic Reserves.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="5834-901c-3f0e-6bc7" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Banishers" id="1eb7-d49c-5fd4-9906" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="fb58-3e37-3723-00e1" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Channelled Force" id="fe3b-9653-6099-06f7" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly unit is selected to fight, if the unit has the GREY KNIGHTS keyword, you may use this ability, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; The triggering unit takes a Leadership test (2D6, passing on its current Leadership or higher); if passed, select one of the following: melee weapons with [PSYCHIC] equipped by the triggering unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1] / melee weapons with [PSYCHIC] equipped by the triggering unit gain [LETHAL HITS].</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="23d2-0f13-1710-94eb" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Warpbane Task Force" id="ce9d-e896-d9bc-767c" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="a81f-fe00-ac19-6e96" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Hallowed Ground" id="8cf0-eca8-b3ec-5c94" hidden="false">
                  <description>Your deployment zone is within Hallowed Ground. At the start of each phase, if you control at least half of the objectives in no man's land, no man's land is within Hallowed Ground until the end of the phase (evaluated once at that time). At the start of each phase, if you control at least half of the objectives in your opponent's deployment zone, your opponent's deployment zone is within Hallowed Ground until the end of the phase (evaluated once at that time). The area within 6" of one or more friendly PURIFIER SQUAD units is within Hallowed Ground, continuously as those units move. For each qualifying attack (for melee attacks or (for ranged attacks and the target is visible to the attacking model)): You can re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If the unit has the PURIFIER SQUAD keyword or every model in the unit is wholly within Hallowed Ground, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="9f89-947a-bc9e-0d9f" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="3"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Brotherhood Strike" id="3f06-4e57-edb4-28e5" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="52cf-7647-8356-35ed" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Fury of Titan" id="d1f5-6ced-2862-2d9a" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly unit is set up, if the triggering unit is using Deep Strike, until the end of the turn:
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Hit roll of 1 for attacks made by the triggering unit.
  -&gt; You can re-roll a Wound roll of 1 for attacks made by the triggering unit.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Purge the Foe" id="aa9b-db16-491c-e496" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="6fe0-3dbe-f7e0-10bb"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Hallowed Conclave" id="bcb7-c2a7-e7fb-3aae" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="4cd9-d156-4354-614f" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Duty Before All" id="e466-2875-80ee-da94" hidden="false">
                  <description>All friendly GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR units are eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Fell Back.
All friendly GREY KNIGHTS TERMINATOR units are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which they Fell Back.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Take and Hold" id="a1c4-08db-345d-f82e" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="1cc1-f11a-4e8f-1bcc"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Sanctic Spearhead" id="fb9d-20f7-3a78-22a3" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="7ffb-6d60-43a3-c044" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Mailed Fist" id="46a7-73d2-68af-1c4d" hidden="false">
                  <description>Each time a friendly unit starts an Advance move (the triggering unit must have GREY KNIGHTS and VEHICLE):
  -&gt; Until the end of the phase: the triggering unit does not make an Advance roll; add 6" to its Move characteristic instead.
  -&gt; Until the end of the turn: ranged weapons equipped by the triggering unit gain [ASSAULT].</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="f7df-4646-8fc7-1e26" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="2"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Argent Assault" id="45aa-c450-8fb0-92c2" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="0f4d-4604-487c-89b5" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="DAUNTLESS CHAMPIONS" id="57a6-57a4-9f2f-cf4a" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a friendly unit is selected to fight (the triggering unit must have PALADIN SQUAD), when the attack's S is less than the target's T, until the end of the phase, the unit gets +1 to Wound rolls.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Priority Assets" id="0676-a3ef-8d17-8cf8" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="0936-9767-1cc7-52ae"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Fires of Purgation" id="cc43-5f22-04f2-5c31" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="c37b-d03e-3c03-f08a" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="SEARING SOULFLAME" id="b5ed-91af-71f7-f94c" hidden="false">
                  <description>When a unit is selected by the Righteous Persecution Grey Knights ability of a friendly PURGATION SQUAD unit, that unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -1 to that test.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Disruption" id="9f4c-5e94-6722-14bd" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="ecf8-cf72-7d5b-1b5b"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Immaterial Interdiction" id="b96b-6cb7-211b-e744" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="e1eb-d4d1-18d4-6620" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="ECHOJUMP" id="e20c-6c94-f406-709a" hidden="false">
                  <description>After a friendly unit shoots (the triggering unit must have INTERCEPTOR SQUAD), you may use this ability, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; The triggering unit loses the Personal Teleporters ability.
  -&gt; The triggering unit can make a Surge move of up to D6+1".</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
                <categoryLink name="Reconnaissance" id="719b-7f66-c94a-3c30" hidden="false" primary="false" targetId="b4a7-5083-fe94-4d24"/>
              </categoryLinks>
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
                <cost name="Detachment Points" typeId="82ae-1066-5107-6ae0" value="1"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="0"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
