              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of each phase, you may use this ability, once per battle per model, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; Select one friendly GREY KNIGHTS unit if the selected unit is within 18" of this model and the selected unit is visible to this model: that unit counts as being within Hallowed Ground.</characteristic>
