  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Gate of Infinity" id="1426-6657-b497-fa07" hidden="false">
      <description>At the end of your opponent's Fight phase, you may use this ability, if your Army Faction is GREY KNIGHTS:
  -&gt; Select up to 2/3/4 friendly units (Incursion/Strike Force/Onslaught) if the selected unit is on the battlefield and the selected unit is unengaged and the selected unit has the Gate of Infinity Crowes Sanctifiers ability: that unit can be placed into Strategic Reserves; it arrives in the Reinforcements step of your next Movement phase, even in the first battle round.</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
